---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Disclaimer — Shri Kundali">
  <div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 0">
    <h1 style="color:#8b4513;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Disclaimer</h1>

    <div style="background:#faf3e8;border:1px solid #d4a373;border-radius:8px;padding:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem">
      <p style="color:#8b4513;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:0.5rem">Important Notice</p>
      <p style="color:#555;line-height:1.8">
        The reports provided by Shri Kundali are based on Vedic astrology principles and are intended for <strong>informational and guidance purposes only</strong>. They are not a substitute for professional financial, legal, or medical advice.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 style="color:#8b4513;font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Not Financial Advice</h2>
    <p style="color:#555;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Our Financial Kundali report provides astrological insights related to career, income, and investments. It is <strong>not SEBI-registered financial advice</strong> and should not be treated as such. Always consult a qualified financial advisor before making investment or loan decisions.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:#8b4513;font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">No Guaranteed Outcomes</h2>
    <p style="color:#555;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Astrological predictions and timing are based on traditional Vedic principles applied to your birth chart. Results vary by individual and are influenced by many factors beyond astrological indications. We do not guarantee any specific outcomes.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:#8b4513;font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Professional Advice</h2>
    <p style="color:#555;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      For medical, legal, financial, or mental health concerns, always consult with qualified professionals in those fields. Our reports are not a replacement for professional consultation.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:#8b4513;font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Accuracy of Birth Data</h2>
    <p style="color:#555;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      The accuracy of astrological readings depends on the accuracy of the birth data provided. If your birth time is unknown or approximate, the reading may be less precise.
    </p>

    <p style="color:#888;font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:2rem;border-top:1px solid #f0e6d6;padding-top:1rem">
      Last updated: September 2026
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
